    "Hi, I need a fee reversal for the card replacement fee on statement ST-697846, into my checking account. My email is elena.sato44@example.com.",
    "Thanks, that's everything.",
    "Hi, I need a fee reversal for the foreign transaction fee on statement ST-320164, into my checking account. My email is tomas.novak43@example.com.",
